WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:41.868
A fluent explanation is not automatically a trace

00:00:41.868 --> 00:01:21.258
Transparency, interpretability and understandability differ

00:01:21.258 --> 00:02:01.630
Trace the input actually sent to retrieval

00:02:01.630 --> 00:02:41.494
The trace can show a boundary without revealing internal scoring

00:02:41.494 --> 00:03:22.421
Walk backwards from the displayed record

00:03:22.421 --> 00:04:01.560
A useful explanation includes what it cannot establish

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:43.638
Inspectable layers are not the whole model decision

00:04:43.638 --> 00:05:27.767
Preserve observations, documentation and unknowns separately
